# T_SCRE: a new item and a new location saved from their menu commands.
# With no list to go back to, each form leaves the note of its save on
# the hint row, where the home screen keeps it while it reads a key.
# The second new location form, left at once, is there only because
# the home screen reads its key before a command, never after the last.
K F4 ENTER CTRL-S
S ITEMNOTE
K ESC
T Spare room
K CTRL-S
S LOCNOTE
K ESC ESC
